     "text": [
      "\n",
      "Pairwise cosine similarity between probe directions:\n",
      "\n",
      "  MMProbe:\n",
      "    cities vs sp_en_trans: 0.2806\n",
      "    cities vs larger_than: 0.0887\n",
      "    sp_en_trans vs larger_than: 0.1439\n",
      "\n",
      "  LRProbe:\n",
      "    cities vs sp_en_trans: 0.1902\n",
